      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kathy%20Warden\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kathy Warden</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">August 2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chair, Chief Executive Officer and President</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Warden is Chair, Chief Executive Officer and President of Northrop Grumman Corporation. She has been CEO and President since January 2019 and was elected Chair of the Board in August 2019. Prior to becoming CEO and President, she served as President and Chief Operating Officer from 2018 to 2019.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kenneth%20Bedingfield\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kenneth Bedingfield</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2015</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Corporate Vice President and Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Bedingfield is Corporate Vice President and Chief Financial Officer of Northrop Grumman Corporation, a role he has held since 2015. He previously served as Corporate Vice President, Controller and Chief Accounting Officer.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Mark%20Caylor\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Mark Caylor</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Corporate Vice President and President, Mission Systems</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Caylor is Corporate Vice President and President, Mission Systems. He previously served as Corporate Vice President and President, Enterprise Services and Chief Strategy Officer.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Sheila%20Cheston\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Sheila Cheston</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2010</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Corporate Vice President and General Counsel</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Cheston is Corporate Vice President and General Counsel. She has served in this role since 2010. Previously, she was General Counsel of BAE Systems, Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Thomas%20Jones\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Thomas Jones</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Corporate Vice President and President, Aeronautics Systems</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Jones is Corporate Vice President and President, Aeronautics Systems. He previously served as Sector Vice President and General Manager, Airborne Sensors & Networks.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ann%20Fudge\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ann Fudge</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2016</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of Young & Rubicam Brands.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Arvind%20Krishna\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Arvind Krishna</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">September 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Member of the Board of Directors</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Arvind Krishna is the Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of IBM. He was elected Chairman of the Board in December 2020 and CEO in April 2020. He was previously Senior Vice President, Cloud and Cognitive Software, and was a principal architect of the acquisition of Red Hat.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/David%20Abney\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">David Abney</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Chairman and CEO of United Parcel Service, Inc. (UPS).</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Donald%20Felsinger\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Donald Felsinger</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2007</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Lead Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of Sempra Energy. Lead Independent Director of Northrop Grumman.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gary%20Roughead\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gary Roughead</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2012</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Member, Board of Directors</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Admiral, U.S. Navy (Retired); former Chief of Naval Operations.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gloria%20Flach\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gloria Flach</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">1981</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Corporate Vice President and Chief Operating Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Chief Operating Officer of Northrop Grumman Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Graham%20Robinson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Graham Robinson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">President, Industrial Automation of Stanley Black & Decker, Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/James%20Turley\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">James Turley</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2015</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Chairman and CEO of Ernst & Young. He has served as Emerson's Chair of the Board since 2021.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kari%20Wilkinson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kari Wilkinson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">Prior to 2011</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Various roles (Ship Program Manager, etc.)</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Kari Wilkinson is executive vice president of HII and president of Ingalls Shipbuilding. She was elected to this position in April 2021. Wilkinson previously served as vice president, program management, at Ingalls Shipbuilding.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kent%20Kresa\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kent Kresa</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">1987</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman, CEO, President</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Kresa has served as a member of our Board since May 2022. He is the Chairman Emeritus of Northrop Grumman Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Linda%20Mills\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Linda Mills</a></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Corporate Vice President</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Mills previously served as Corporate Vice President of Operations for Northrop Grumman Corporation. She has significant experience in large-scale systems integration and operations.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Linnie%20Haynesworth\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Linnie Haynesworth</a></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Sector Vice President and General Manager</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Haynesworth was a Sector Vice President and General Manager at Northrop Grumman Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Madeleine%20Kleiner\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Madeleine Kleiner</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2008</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Vice President and General Counsel of Hilton Hotels Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Marianne%20Brown\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Marianne Brown</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2015</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Marianne C. Brown was Co-Chief Operating Officer, Global Financial Solutions, of Fidelity National Information Services, Inc. (FIS).</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Mark%20Welsh%20III\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Mark Welsh III</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2016</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Member, Board of Directors</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">General, U.S. Air Force (Retired); President of Texas A&M University; former Chief of Staff of the U.S. Air Force.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Prabu%20Natarajan\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Prabu Natarajan</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2011</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Various financial, tax, and management roles</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Natarajan has served as our Chief Financial Officer since January 2021. Prior to joining SAIC, he served as Vice President of Financial Planning and Analysis and Mergers and Acquisitions at Northrop Grumman Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Richard%20Myers\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Richard Myers</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2006</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">General Myers served as the 15th Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff. He was the President of Kansas State University from 2016 to 2022. He serves on the boards of Aon plc and Rivian Automotive, Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ronald%20Sugar\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ronald Sugar</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2003</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman and CEO</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Dr. Sugar is the former Chairman and CEO of Northrop Grumman Corporation, where he served from 2003 to 2010.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Thomas%20Schoewe\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Thomas Schoewe</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2011</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Vice President and CFO of Walmart Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Thomas%20Stiehle\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Thomas Stiehle</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">~1987</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Shipbuilding-Gulf Coast CFO / Various roles (24-year career)</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Thomas E. Stiehle is executive vice president and chief financial officer of HII. He was elected to this position in February 2021. Stiehle previously served as vice president, business management, and chief financial officer for HII’s Ingalls Shipbuilding division. Prior to joining HII in 2011, he worked for Northrop Grumman.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Wesley%20Bush\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Wesley Bush</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2005</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Chairman and CEO of Northrop Grumman Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/William%20Hernandez\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">William Hernandez</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2013</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Senior Vice President and Chief Financial Officer of PPG Industries, Inc.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kathy%20Warden\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kathy Warden</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">August 2019</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chair</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chair, Chief Executive Officer and President of Northrop Grumman Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/David%20Abney\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">David Abney</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2020</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Chairman of the Board and Chief Executive Officer of United Parcel Service, Inc. (UPS).</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Marianne%20Brown\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Marianne Brown</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2015</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Co-Chief Operating Officer, Global Financial Solutions of Fidelity National Information Services, Inc. (FIS).</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Donald%20Felsinger\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Donald Felsinger</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2007</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Lead Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of Sempra Energy. Lead Independent Director of Northrop Grumman.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ann%20Fudge\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ann Fudge</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2016</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of Young & Rubicam Brands.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/William%20Hernandez\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">William Hernandez</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2013</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Senior Vice President and Chief Financial Officer of PPG Industries, Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Madeleine%20Kleiner\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Madeleine Kleiner</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2008</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Vice President and General Counsel of Hilton Hotels Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Arvind%20Krishna\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Arvind Krishna</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of IBM.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Graham%20Robinson\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Graham Robinson</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">President, Industrial Automation of Stanley Black & Decker, Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Gary%20Roughead\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Gary Roughead</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2012</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Admiral, U.S. Navy (Retired); former Chief of Naval Operations.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Thomas%20Schoewe\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Thomas Schoewe</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2011</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer of Wal-Mart Stores, Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/James%20Turley\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">James Turley</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2015</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Former Chairman and Chief Executive Officer of Ernst & Young.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Mark%20Welsh%20III\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Mark Welsh III</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2016</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">General, U.S. Air Force (Retired); President of Texas A&M University; former Chief of Staff of the U.S. Air Force.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kent%20Kresa\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kent Kresa</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">1987</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman, CEO, President</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Kresa has served as a member of our Board since May 2022. He is the Chairman Emeritus of Northrop Grumman Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Richard%20Myers\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Richard Myers</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2006</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">General Myers served as the 15th Chairman of the Joint Chiefs of Staff. He was the President of Kansas State University from 2016 to 2022. He serves on the boards of Aon plc and Rivian Automotive, Inc.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Ronald%20Sugar\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Ronald Sugar</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2003</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chairman and CEO</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Dr. Sugar is the former Chairman and CEO of Northrop Grumman Corporation, where he served from 2003 to 2010.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/ix?doc=/Archives/edgar/data/1133421/000113342124000010/noc-20240322.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">Northrop Grumman Corporation 2024 Proxy Statement (DEF 14A)</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-03-22)</span></li></ul>"
    }
